 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "A seal for the covenant «ميثاق», a scroll for «الكلم» (leaving before «ونسوا»). No people (no twelve figures for the chiefs), no motif on Musa, nothing literal for the gardens. Al-Muyassar's first-person «بحفظي ونصري», «برسلي», «سبيلي», «طردناهم» are not used. STAGING v4: 12: the Children of Israel as a small group (3) on open land; the place of the covenant is not given by the tafsirs, so a plain desert, and Musa (named only by Al-Muyassar) is not drawn. The twelve chiefs are not drawn (a group of 12 cannot be shown, and fewer would be a wrong number). Nothing is acted during the conditions (12:16-27: no prayer, no giving), Paradise is not drawn (light plate on the forgiveness 12:28), two-paths plate for straying (12:37). 13: the same group (3, no woman) turns its back on 13:2 (breaking the covenant); scroll plate for the altered words (13:9-11, leaving before forgetting). The few who kept the covenant are 2 countable believers who appear on 13:23. The pardon is the Prophet's own conduct: shown only by a wide shot, nobody faces an empty side. Geometric on the Name 13:30."
 },
